codex
The selected family is the paper’s native “Grouped 2-way Partition” (Section 2.3, Theorem 2.2), not a scheduling surrogate. Generation composes equal-pair-sum identities among within-group deviations; verification only recomputes the two exact bin loads. I’m implementing it as Track B because the paper explicitly gives a pseudopolynomial DP, while the hidden quartet decomposition is the short no-tool route.
