codex
The generator is complete and passes all nine local gates, but final hardening is blocked by OpenRouter’s HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded.”

Key results:

- Native Grouped 2-way Partition from the paper’s Section 2.3/Theorem 2.2; `TRACK = "B"`. [Paper](https://arxiv.org/html/2603.12999v1)
- 0/200,000 structure-aware random guesses.
- Six attacks: 0/8 successes each.
- Reference exact DP: 8/8, up to 33,300,648 word operations.
- Compact route: 8/8 in 180 exact operations.
- Answer: 145 characters, 72 elements.

Files:

- [Generator](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2603.12999/gen_2603_12999.py)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2603.12999/selftest_report.json)
- [README](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2603.12999/README.md)
